    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Suspect it's because the cpython bytecode compiler is constant folding and the run time values are out of int range?\r\n```python\r\nfrom numba import njit\r\n\r\n@njit\r\ndef demo(a,b,c):\r\n    print(a**b % c)\r\n    print(11**19 % 1009)\r\n\r\na, b, c = 11, 19, 1009\r\ndemo(a,b,c)\r\n\r\nimport dis\r\nprint(dis.dis(demo))\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2021-05-27T12:53:56Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/numba/numba/issues/7062#issuecomment-849609732",
    "id": 849609732,
